<title>JAPAN: FamilyMart plans share split.</title>
<headline>FamilyMart plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>FamilyMart Co Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on April 21, for shareholders as of February 28.</p>
</text>
